Key(s)                    Action                    Description
n                         next                      Find the next match
N                         prev                      Find the previous match
|                         gotocolumn                Find a column by name and
\                         gotocolumnnext            Jump to the next column m
e                         open                      Open another CSV file
f                         filter                    Filter rows (any case); /
F                         filtercol                 Filter on this column
:                         subcommand                Editor subcommand
<esc> to exit help Find the next match
